# .gitignore - Society Management documentation toolchain
#
# Scope: exclude only installed dependencies and build-generated documentation
# artifacts. The following are intentionally NOT ignored so they remain tracked:
#   - authored Markdown sources    docs/**/*.md
#   - source / test trees          src/  tests/
#   - the consolidated deliverable docs/Society-Management-Documentation.pdf
#   - the source archive           society_mgmt_300k.zip
#   - the dependency lockfile      package-lock.json
# Keep this file minimal and scoped; do not add a blanket *.pdf or docs/ ignore.

# Dependencies
# Installed by `npm install` from the documentation toolchain in package.json.
node_modules/

# Logs
# npm / runtime log noise; never part of the documentation deliverable.
# npm-debug.log* also catches rotated logs (e.g. npm-debug.log.1) that *.log misses.
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Generated documentation artifacts (regenerated by the docs build)
# `npm run docs:diagrams` renders diagram sources to SVG here via `mmdc` on every
# build, so these build outputs are not tracked. Scoped narrowly to this directory
# (no blanket *.svg) to avoid touching authored content elsewhere.
docs/assets/diagrams/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
